# Knowledge Filter Cron Job Template

## Add to cron/jobs.json

```json
{
  "name": "knowledge-filter",
  "schedule": "every 60m",
  "script": "knowledge_filter_cron.py",
  "prompt": "Run knowledge filter on latest RSS/YouTube cache, insert filtered knowledge into KC, report stats",
  "enabled": true,
  "skills": ["automation/knowledge-filter"]
}
```

## Manual Run

```bash
# From Hermes root
python scripts/knowledge_filter_cron.py
```

