## Integration with Existing Cron

The knowledge filter should run AFTER parsers:
1. `rss-monitor` (every 240m) — fetches feeds
2. `youtube-watch` (every 360m) — fetches videos
3. `knowledge-filter` (every 60m) — filters & inserts

This ensures fresh cache is available.